  "_grantable_roles_README": [
    "Role modifiers a member can hold ON TOP of their rank. Not ranks: holding one never",
    "changes column F, the member's category or their standing in the permission system.",
    "Given and revoked with /grant add and /grant remove by anyone who may use SET_RANK on",
    "the member. Stored on the member's record (hidden technical column Y), so they survive",
    "rank and branch changes until revoked.",
    "",
    "key                      stable internal id, UPPERCASE. Must start with a letter; letters,",
    "                         digits, spaces and _ & . / - only (no commas).",
    "display                  the name shown in /grant and in /aria whois",
    "guild                    WHERE it applies: \"MAIN\" for the main server, or a branch key",
    "                         (e.g. \"ECHELON\") for that branch's own server. One server per",
    "                         grantable role. A branch scope does NOT require the member to",
    "                         belong to that branch.",
    "add_discord_role_ids     roles granted on top of what the rank and branch already give.",
    "                         Managed, so they come off again when the role is revoked.",
    "remove_discord_role_ids  roles the rank or branch would otherwise give in that server,",
    "                         which this modifier cancels. Only subtracts from those roles:",
    "                         listing a role no rank or branch grants has no effect.",
    "",
    "If one held grantable role adds a role that another one removes, the add wins.",
    "",
    "Example:",
    "  \"EVENT_HOST\": {",
    "    \"display\": \"Event Host\",",
    "    \"guild\": \"MAIN\",",
    "    \"add_discord_role_ids\": [111111111111111111],",
    "    \"remove_discord_role_ids\": []",
    "  }"
  ],
  "grantable_roles": {
